          "source_id": "s-shiji-059-wuzong",
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-059-wuzong:p007",
          "quote": "榮最長，死無後，國除，地入于漢，為南郡。",
          "person_mention_id": "c-shiji-059-wuzong:m007-0000"
